OL,3,GNEWSABadly cracked road means 'no need
OL,4,Afor bike stands'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cyclist has highlighted the issue of
OL,7,Fcracked roads after discovering one
OL,8,Fmeasuring "around half a metre deep" on
OL,9,Fa country road in Lincolnshire.
OL,11,FChris Nagel, 40, was enjoying a bike
OL,12,Fride from his home in Wainfleet along
OL,13,FThorpe Bank on Sunday when he took a
OL,14,Fphoto of his bike standing in the
OL,15,Ffissure.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
