OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1787104557
OL,1,W5j 5Quzj#5w;jp%p05 jj#57+G2/G2/2
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%%** %  -,** %-. (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSABadly cracked road means 'no need
OL,4,Afor bike stands'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNagel said: "I drive and ride my
OL,7,Fmotorcycle on that road regularly, but
OL,8,Feven though I go steady along that
OL,9,Fstretch, it's still too fast to really
OL,10,Fsee how bad the road surface really is.
OL,11,FYou'll only see it properly as a
OL,12,Fcyclist or a pedestrian."
OL,14,FShaun Butcher, of Lincolnshire County
OL,15,FCouncil, said the authority was "aware
OL,16,Fof the issues mentioned" and would "fix
OL,17,Fthem in accordance with our policies".
